PathScan Updates

Version 1.0.0 (Initial Release Features)
-------------------------------------------------  
- Drive Connectivity Check: Added currectly connected (cc) command to list connected drives and their status
- Directory Scanning: Support for scanning the current directory (cd) or any specific drive (e.g., C, D, etc.)
- Output Folder Management: Automatically creates a PathScan folder on the desktop for organizing output files
- Timestamped Outputs: Output files include hostname, date, and time for easy tracking
- Comprehensive Path Collection: Recursively collects file and folder paths from the selected directory or drive
- File Analysis Module: Allows analysis of output files to search for specific keywords or file types using the (an) command
- Export Capabilities: Filters and exports search results into an organized export folder
- Formatted Outputs: Clean and structured output files for readability

